Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.13,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I could burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing. Feel it's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those officers were like\Ndemons straight out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But they were a joke to the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they're on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads up, fish people!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes on the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Danger's on the way down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one on Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fours are flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could have dropped him in a\Nplace with less people, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep complaining and I'll\Ndrop the next giant on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That was downright amazing, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Chopper, you mind shrinking down some?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally upstaging\Nmy giant robot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, that beam was so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That robot was utterly useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really wear a miniskirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really read my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Expected no less from Luffy's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an Owa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Owa's right above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna crush every last one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune's army might trap us in the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those psycho officers can't stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, are we too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do something Stop that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is still fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not giving up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe what I'm seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He still has strength. length!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's attacking the Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's breaking apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be alright if he can\Nobliterate it before it crashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but if he's unable to,\Nthen we're all doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be the end for Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it everything you got, Lupi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it happen, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're rooting for you down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be a human but you've\Ngot all of our support!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We ain't running nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Straw Hacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We all believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We save our country, Straw Hacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Save us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear it apart, Straw Hacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need that ship anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Snowhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Snowhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Snowhead! Snowhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Terror it to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wreck it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon is opening up again! J-Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters now with speed,\Ncarry the damn thing apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you dumb shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that this had to happen, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying the Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing the ship of promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But what can be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My people's lives are more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I cannot keep the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Joy Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You may stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to kill yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Move with me, Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so tight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's gonna die if I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you just look?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Noah stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea kinks, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it when you yell at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got bigger problems to deal with!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what this means,\Nbut I think it's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, the Noah's not falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the Sea King seriously stop the Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're losing so much\Nblood from that wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get you to a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it's okay, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.86,0:10:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as long as the ship is stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad everyone is safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, that there\Nis one hell of a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, to say the least, he\Nsure is strong, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we had been late, the\Nisland would have been saved,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,at the cost of the Noah being\Ncompletely destroyed, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good thing\Nwe did make it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am glad that Princess Shirahoshi\Ncalled out to us like that, just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't do anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your will and the will of the human\Nechoed as one becoming a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A prayer to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your desire to save your people was so\Nstrong, and we all heard it loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not nearly as\Nhelpless as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the Sea\NKingdoms is yours as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are in need, then\Nwe shall heed your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,People of the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what just happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure if I can describe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But, whatever it was, it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Noah, it's been stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's damaged, but not destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Frishman Island has been saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Straw Hat would save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shirahoshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't imagine how long we see kings\Nwaited for you to be born into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Waited for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This vessel was designed for\Nus to pull it, can't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This responsibility has been passed\Ndown for as long as anyone can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, is that the reason\Nwhy the Noah is so large?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:14:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our queen appears once\Nevery several centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,though we do not know why she\Nalways takes the form of a mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But we do know that ever\Nsince you were born,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you have been our exalted queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it, but I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our sister is speaking with the Sea Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to believe this, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but a bunch of Sea Kings just showed up\Nout of the blue and they took hold of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not sure I understand\Nwhat they're saying, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess they stepped\Nin because they wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,to stop Luffy from smashing\Nthe Noah to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For whatever reason, that shit must\Nbe really important to them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.06,0:14:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:15:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it's finally awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The power that can\Ndestroy this entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble's being absorbed\Nby the island bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't survive in the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You must retrieve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know better, I'd\Nsay that the human wearing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the hat was able to hear\Nus as well I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It has happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh, did you hear\Nthat voice just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's obviously nobody down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I hearing strange voices\Nat the bottom of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite mysterious indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeking's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're pulling the Noah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Noah is crumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it be saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it serve its purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I believe it could be\Nsaved if we had their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this is a different age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then can it be repaired?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The appointed time is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister of the Left, sir, we have a\Nreport from inside the Ryugu palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the good news is we've located\Nall the mermaids who were kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out they're right\Nhere on the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me they're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they said they're still\Nfeeling a bit disoriented,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,sir, but they do remember\Nwhat the culprit looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news is the treasure\Nchamber's been wiped clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They took it all down to the last piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We even lost the tomate box, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,someone seems to have robbed\Nus during the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stolen treasures do not concern us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, not moments ago, we\Nnearly lost our entire kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.20,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The best thing to do at present is tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the citizens that the mermaids are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage may be done, but we still\Nneed to clear the Straw Hats' names.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We must do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you if you try to get a worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kill us boss team day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.84,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta let us out of\Nhere We only did this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,stuff cuz we were scared\Nof holding in his crib.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We are humans You know this fish man\Ncivil war things got nothing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,with us besides tourism from human\Npirates is good for their economy So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah, come on man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let us go, please the punishment\Nmay not be as terrible as you think
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us wait to hear the\Nroyal family's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one fact of which we must make.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.74,0:18:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,all of you aware the mermaids are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for the Straw Hats they\Nwere not involved in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We humbly admit that\Nmistakes were made in our
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,investigation for the\Nunrest that this has caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We must apologize you know i never\Ndoubted the Straw Hats for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it wasn't them from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just didn't want to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all to blame. Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't trust them for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, we believed them\Nall along, right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.56,0:19:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard what you said. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We all believed the Straw\NHats were responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We judged them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because they were humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We've always been like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:19:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, only cooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I use\NMonster Point, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That one wears me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to walk for a few hours,\Nbut I can still treat your injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now those hurt, let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about yourself first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like everyone here is fine\Nexcept for me after all that fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to rest my head, too Only\Nyour lap can heal me, please
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest it up your ass instead\Nif Robin wants me to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princes are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hordean Deccan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry we worried you, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me, citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.09,0:20:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again will these villains\Ncause trouble for our kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this been a crazy day or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible monster that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think he was right\Nhere in our neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.82,0:21:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Horton, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouted! Who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems she's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the princess\Nand Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.18,0:21:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't stop bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he's going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's so brave, he could've\Ndied out there, fighting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks bad, but I've got a\Nfew hemostatics here in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Robin? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that new form really\Nworth doing this every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you, Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.07,0:22:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of doctor are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A little left, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, doctor, tell me Luffy's\Ngoing to be alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.96,0:22:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He can stop the bleeding, but\Nhe's lost an awful lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs a donor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's the only one of us with type F.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.96,0:22:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be someone who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm type F.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the right type, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, you're type F, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot in this country there's actually\Na law against donating blood to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of law is that? It's cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy just saved you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to help but I'm afraid\Nmy blood isn't tight enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It is red though!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not really how it works but thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.92,0:23:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shiromoshi. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the human pirates could help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can give him some of my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's type f.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take as much as you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.45,0:23:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Really thanks, Jimbae!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait but the law...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,what of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.46,0:23:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate boss, Jimbae.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the boss, Jimbae!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jimbae!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.44,0:23:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.35,0:23:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes it so wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's precisely that kind of thinking\Nthat caused this to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It might sting a little, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.30,0:24:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.58,0:24:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you harm someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.94,0:24:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.10,0:24:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,if someone harms you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.92,0:24:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the same red
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.02,0:24:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,blood is spilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.90,0:25:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And this tube through\Nwhich that blood flows,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,small and fragile though it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.66,0:25:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,provides a pathway,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.66,0:25:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,through
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.64,0:25:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the prejudice
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.55,0:25:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that divides us,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.18,0:25:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.09,0:25:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,conflicts
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.01,0:25:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that we create.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.28,0:25:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,as though they were never there at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And more than any fleeting\Ndream or fantasy could,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.58,0:26:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this path can guide us to the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,into the warm light of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Bay Luffy. It scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.78,0:26:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.24,0:26:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You rascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.44,0:26:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, Reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.56,0:27:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.70,0:27:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to Saru.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.02,0:27:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zunbei.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.52,0:27:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to join my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.78,0:27:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The royal family has reached a decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.22,0:27:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Freak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.28,0:27:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally free!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Wardy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.24,0:27:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who's in chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.36,0:27:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry that I was going to be a\Nslave for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.66,0:28:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll repay you someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.70,0:28:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,After I become king of the pirates? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.34,0:28:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bit ambitious Hey,\Nwhat's wrong with having trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.38,0:28:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, pirates, I can set\Nsail for the new world?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.46,0:28:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty? Are you sure it's\Nwise to release Hody's human slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.70,0:28:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let such fears turn\Nus into something we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.72,0:28:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This island has always been a welcoming,\Nsafe place for pirates to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.98,0:28:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And these humans never meant\Nus any deliberate harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.86,0:28:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no right to imprison them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.32,0:28:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, as for the rest\Nof the new Fishman Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.66,0:28:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cut my head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please bear our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.24,0:28:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.58,0:28:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't know anything about\NHeart killing the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.20,0:28:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We got duped by a bunch of lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.44,0:28:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.35,0:28:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Horty's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.08,0:28:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.54,0:28:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I officially order you all to\Nlive here on the main island.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.22,0:28:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.32,0:29:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling us to\Nlive law-abiding lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.54,0:29:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be a lot worse,\Nbetter than working for Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.62,0:29:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.53,0:29:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.82,0:29:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want them living among us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.00,0:29:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't feel safe to let our\Nkids walk down the street!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.20,0:29:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To clarify,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.68,0:29:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you will serve your time, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.58,0:29:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will work under\Nthe supervision of my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.98,0:29:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I will provide you all with gainful\Nemployment to use up all that energy of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.26,0:29:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And from this day forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the Fishman District will be sealed\Noff and all entry prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.02,0:29:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark side of the\NFishman had been exposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.38,0:29:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the true\Nkiller of Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.12,0:29:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The conspirator, Heart Jones, attempted\Nto seize control of Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.86,0:29:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But he failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to a band of\Nhuman pirates who happened
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.28,0:29:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to be passing through\Nat just the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.04,0:29:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen Straw Hat Luffy around?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.44,0:29:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he, um, absconded.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.34,0:30:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you leave the plaza\Nwithout saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.36,0:30:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not too big on attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw how many spectators we\Nhad watching us fight down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.86,0:30:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stick around, they'd just treat\Nus like heroes or some dumb crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.04,0:30:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the thought of it\Nmakes me want to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.78,0:30:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a good thing to\Nbe the hero of a nation?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.34,0:30:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.25,0:30:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A man who shares his sake with\Nother people, now that's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.58,0:30:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want it all for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.76,0:30:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your damn sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.14,0:30:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop putting dumb ideas in her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.28,0:30:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you join us, Deep Bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.18,0:30:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've got adventure in your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it'll be the most\Nfun you've ever had, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.66,0:30:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Crew up with us, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.50,0:30:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be awesome to have\Na former warlord with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.22,0:30:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And helpful!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.56,0:30:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy could take a little break!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.66,0:30:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's impossible\Nfor me to join you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.14,0:30:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am still grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.92,0:30:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It is an honor that you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.36,0:31:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain that it would be the adventure\Nof my life to sail the sea with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.28,0:31:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am afraid I don't have the\Nluxury to indulge in such pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.04,0:31:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have responsibilities\Nthat I must fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.60,0:31:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I put them off long enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.66,0:31:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I've seen, to my duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm free from my sworn obligations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.56,0:31:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll set sail and seek you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.54,0:31:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you haven't changed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.66,0:31:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And still wish for me to\Nbecome a member of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.42,0:31:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll gladly take\Nyou up on your offer then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.52,0:31:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see fit to have me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.48,0:31:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You better keep that promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.34,0:31:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A man's got to do what a man's got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.46,0:31:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him some time, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.16,0:31:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really taken with Jean-Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.42,0:31:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy made it clear you're worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.80,0:32:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you need some me time, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.16,0:32:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That is very gracious of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.06,0:32:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are we doing next? Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A new world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.49,0:32:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.92,0:32:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't thanked you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.66,0:32:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.22,0:32:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, we've hardly spoken at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's settled then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.36,0:32:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay at the Mermaid\NCafe a whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.84,0:32:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some kind of nosebleed death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.48,0:32:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.40,0:32:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.46,0:32:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he must be a\Nsoldier from Neptune's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.02,0:32:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, please wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.06,0:32:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.06,0:32:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right here and listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.17,0:32:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, my friend, why did\Nyou leave in such a rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.80,0:32:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.06,0:32:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be\Ntreated like a damn hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.14,0:32:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can appreciate that,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.84,0:32:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least let me throw you the\Nbanquet that we originally set to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.26,0:32:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Banquet? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.94,0:32:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go pick up Pachi and Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.02,0:33:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And with Neptune's official decree\Nthe fishman district was sealed off
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.66,0:33:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the fate of Heart his\Nofficers of the new fishman pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And Vanderdecken, they were all\Nlocked away within the prison tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.32,0:33:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it. Kraken take him far away.\NWhat I'm assuming you may not fit in our
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.64,0:33:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,prison cells but you are forbidden\Nfrom ever entering this country again!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.46,0:33:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you catch some? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.26,0:33:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.64,0:33:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get them prepared and\Ntake them up to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This banquet for the Straw Hats is\Ngoing to be a night to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.34,0:33:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.48,0:33:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll get their fill of\Nsea monster meat, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.84,0:33:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're bringing all the\Nsnacks and cakes we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard they got bottomless stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.00,0:33:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We better back all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.38,0:33:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And every cask of sake we've got, they're\Ndrinking nothing but the best tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.44,0:34:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the palace, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.88,0:34:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honored you've chosen to join us,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.96,0:34:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm eager to speak with\Nyou during the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.30,0:34:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Long Flounders will be\Narriving to take you to the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.70,0:34:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, those are some huge\Nrays. They're flukes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.84,0:34:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought he just\Ncalled them flounders.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.34,0:34:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.82,0:34:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So surreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.94,0:34:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really letting us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.28,0:34:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, it's the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.90,0:34:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.14,0:34:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, where's the meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.12,0:34:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the heroes have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.24,0:34:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at all the soldiers down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.24,0:34:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't anybody's damn heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.72,0:34:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just want to eat the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.56,0:34:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and drink all of your sake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.04,0:34:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,First look at the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.70,0:35:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This way! You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.60,0:35:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We proudly present the greatest\Ndiva of the deep sea, Marina Napol!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.14,0:35:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And her backing band,\Nthe Swing Jazz Orchestra!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.80,0:36:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.71,0:36:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She is the voice of an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's proper!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.12,0:36:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.03,0:36:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seek it, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.95,0:36:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rocking my soul\Nright out of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.22,0:36:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please welcome our special get.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.22,0:36:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.42,0:36:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Their beauty has stolen the breath of\Ncountless sailors and pirates alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.32,0:36:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mermaid Cafe
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.94,0:36:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancers! Be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.46,0:37:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Doin' die!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.30,0:37:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No picture in the world\Ncould capture their beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.32,0:37:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sugar touched the sea water.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.72,0:37:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Katie?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.52,0:37:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.16,0:37:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.08,0:37:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be a banquet without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.78,0:37:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet, me first, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.64,0:37:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's everything I dreamed it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.00,0:37:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Down here, mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.40,0:37:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.30,0:38:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace to peace. To peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.94,0:38:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, drink them!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.52,0:38:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.66,0:38:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying to!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.78,0:38:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fungie, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.82,0:38:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get so carried away, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.70,0:38:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, you will listen as\NI briefly express my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.78,0:38:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.82,0:38:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Cheers! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.14,0:38:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.80,0:38:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's forget the speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.14,0:38:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! Cheers! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.52,0:38:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.20,0:38:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it have something\Nto do with the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.00,0:38:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a kind of silly\Nold lady, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.74,0:38:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fill her up! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.66,0:38:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look so shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.20,0:38:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That is some real tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.56,0:39:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My face is a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.06,0:39:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The party is rocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.40,0:39:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, shit, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.58,0:39:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The beat is dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.02,0:39:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I mean, come dance with Ricky!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.74,0:39:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.65,0:39:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.74,0:39:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.28,0:39:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, pirate girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.96,0:39:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to speak with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.84,0:39:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize, but this seemed like my\Nonly chance to get you alone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.02,0:39:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen here, I'm very flattered, but\NI swore to love my wife Otohime forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.52,0:39:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be dead, but I\Nmust honor the oath I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.24,0:39:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know who Joy Boy is. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it myself, the\Nponeglyph in the sea forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.10,0:39:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who exactly is he apologizing to?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.28,0:39:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that you can read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.36,0:40:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a survivor of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.76,0:40:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me\Nanything if you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.62,0:40:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will gladly tell you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.52,0:40:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You've proven yourself trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.82,0:40:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What I know of Joy Boy is that\Nhe was a person from above the
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.00,0:40:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,sea who lived during the time of\Nthe hundred year void which is to
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.18,0:40:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,say more than 800 years ago the\Nmessage you read he wrote to a
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.54,0:40:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,mermaid princess who lived on this\Nisland during that time period
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.80,0:40:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it is a letter of apology\Nfor failing to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.80,0:40:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the promise he made to\Nthis island what promise
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.52,0:40:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm afraid that i don't know\Nthe specific details but
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.52,0:40:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,according to the legend it\Nsaid that somebody will come to
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.62,0:40:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,fulfill it someday on behalf\Nof joy boy at least that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.30,0:40:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,story that's been passed down\Nthrough our royal family and
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.94,0:41:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we firmly believe that\Nthis day will come so we've
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.12,0:41:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,continued to look after the\Nnoah for generations just as we
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.94,0:41:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,promised him and when the time\Narrives the noah will finally
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.98,0:41:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,be put to its intended use\Nwhatever that may be i see now i
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.72,0:41:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't help but overhear\Nthat the half-destroyed noah
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.30,0:41:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,was taken to the sea forest\Nafter the battle came to an
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.90,0:41:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,end today by the sea kings that\Nis if joy boy truly planned
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.14,0:41:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to use the noah i have to\Nwonder if he had control of the
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.74,0:41:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,sea kings no it was actually\Nthe former mermaid princess
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.28,0:41:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,who possessed that fearsome\Npower that's what i thought and
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.46,0:41:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,now Shirahoshi has the same\Nability she has for quite some
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.64,0:41:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time, but it seems that it did\Nnot fully awaken until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.80,0:41:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say that I'm terribly pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.26,0:42:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.44,0:42:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,up in Shandora, I read a poneglyph that\Nlocated one of the ancient weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.66,0:42:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All signs indicated this very island.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.04,0:42:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This mermaid princess who lived\Nduring the same time as Joy Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.78,0:42:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She was known by another\Nname as well wasn't she.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.98,0:42:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Shirahoshi\Npossesses the same power
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.48,0:42:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so she will come to\Ninherit the same name too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.22,0:42:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A terrible thing for\Na father to hear, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.94,0:42:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She is the ancient weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.62,0:42:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Poseidon.
